{"id":1432,"name":"Rheinfall Rundweg","category":"hike","country":"CH","generated_at":"2026-08-14T08:54:05+00:00","description_md":"The Rheinfall Rundweg is an easy waymarked hiking route in Switzerland spanning 7.4 km. This circular trail features 94 m of ascent and 93 m of descent, with an estimated walking time of about 2.1 hours on the DIN 33466 hiking time rule.\n\nThe route is signposted as 896 and belongs to the local waymarked hiking network. Its line matches the official route published by swisstopo. Walkers will pass within 100 m of Wörth Castle, the Rhine Falls, and Rhine Falls in Schaffhausen.","distance_m":7435,"ascent_m":94,"descent_m":93,"duration_min":126,"difficulty":"easy","sac_scale":null,"network":"lwn","bbox":[8.607279,47.666915,8.628703,47.682663],"geometry":{"type":"MultiLineString","coordinates":[[[8.614248,47.666915,394.7],[8.614138,47.667016,394.7],[8.614052,47.667092,394.6],[8.613935,47.667204,394.8],[8.61387,47.667213,395],[8.613802,47.667198,395.1],[8.613728,47.667236,395.3],[8.613705,47.667257,395.4],[8.613684,47.667276,395.4],[8.613345,47.667581,395.7],[8.612747,47.66813,394.9],[8.612466,47.668503,394.8],[8.612969,47.668706,394.8],[8.612772,47.668844,395.3],[8.612676,47.66893,395.4],[8.61253,47.66908,395],[8.612297,47.669346,394.5],[8.612051,47.669664,394.1],[8.611856,47.669948,393.3],[8.611682,47.670243,392.8],[8.611596,47.670413,392.8],[8.611557,47.670515,392.8],[8.611532,47.670676,392.7],[8.611514,47.67084,392.4],[8.611535,47.670951,392.4],[8.61158,47.671046,392.4],[8.611625,47.671106,392.4],[8.61189,47.671402,394],[8.611953,47.67153,394.3],[8.611967,47.671593,394.4],[8.61196,47.671774,394.8],[8.61195,47.671958,395.5],[8.611924,47.672186,396.8],[8.611888,47.672434,398.2],[8.611832,47.672739,399.3],[8.61181,47.672955,399.9],[8.611806,47.673121,400.7],[8.611833,47.673194,401.1],[8.611833,47.67331,401.6],[8.611859,47.673432,402],[8.61219,47.67434,402.9],[8.612264,47.674503,403.2],[8.612404,47.674735,403.5],[8.612534,47.674924,403.9],[8